# twin: render_one
# One console that draws the two-part picture in Vulkan, hands part 1's
# command buffer over for the frontend to submit and passes set_image a
# semaphore nothing signals: with command buffers handed over the
# frontend waits on none of set_image's semaphores, or its submit waits on
# one nothing signals.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_handoff commands_semaphore
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
